  "notes": "Adds explicit Wi-Fi OTA work-screen boot intent for post-update startup. Reworks the native interior LED menu as a three-row selection and removes redundant flashlight scrolling. Removes the charging route from flashlight mode. Charge wake leaves the flashlight lamp off regardless of USB state; Desktop/Settings lamp controls remain available with USB attached. Retains 0.1.539 flashlight profile and range qualification, including near bowl/alias rejection and Smoke target continuity; no 1 m sensor-range claim is made. New hardware acceptance is pending, including the 0.1.539 post-OTA automatic-startup regression. Old SW6106 hardware diagnostics remain paused.",
